                ],
                "notes": "This game contains cartoon gore:\r\nThe later stages of the game have bosses and enemies that are zombies, and they are mutilated or otherwise heavily injured, though it is still presented in a cartoon style.\r\n\r\nThe game does have themes of Suicide:\r\nOne of the final levels also has nooses in the background that the player cannot interact with. The boss of this level is a reanimated hanging body that attacks the player and the player must fight back in order to progress through the game. This depiction is also depicted in a cartoon style, but it can still be gruesome or disturbing to some players.\r\n\r\nNote: The mature content of this game is intended to appear in the later half of the game."
            },
